    <ul class="beliefs">
      <li><div><h3>Clarity of purpose comes first</h3><p>When all around you is murky, the job is to help you see the light, then act on it.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>Evidence beats opinion</h3><p>Including our own. Every finding is labelled and rated, and we say what we could not establish.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>Honest challenge is a kindness</h3><p>Aimed at systems, not people, and said to the board as much as to the executive.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>Being more charitable is good business</h3><p>Purpose and profit are not opposites. The companies that get this win work and keep people.</p></div></li>
      <li><div><h3>The people you serve are the experts</h3><p>Lived experience belongs in the evidence, not in a box on the last page.</p></div></li>
